==Trivia==
* Although Keith Norman himself does not make an appearance in the movie {{DetPikMov}}, [[Howard Clifford]]'s [[Howard Clifford#Pokémon|Ditto]] is nicknamed "Ms. Norman," a likely reference to Keith's last name. Ms. Norman's role is similar to Keith's, wherein they act as the main henchman for the true mastermind of the R conspiracy.

